      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Troops (Okada): a two-column warichu note in place of a figure — 'not ascertained; the number of soldiers cannot yet be settled; reported in the 10th month of 己巳 (1869).' No troop count is given. (First glyph is 審 with a 宀 roof, not 書; the verb is 仕兼候 = 'unable to do', not 仕様候.)"
